      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AZTEC STATE (1) gets the nod on the strength of his Melbourne form from last campaign, with fifths in BM84 and BM78 company at Caulfield and Flemington reading well for this assignment. He has not raced around 1100m and resumes from a long absence, but a close third in a Rockhampton trial gives him a suitable platform to run boldly fresh. METALCRAFT (4) is the obvious danger after three wins from three runs this campaign, including a nose decision in a CL5 win at Townsville. He's 2/2 here and gets his chance to add to the record. THEE CREEK (6) beat ALLOUTATIME in a BM65 at this track last week and has won two of three this prep, though METALCRAFT had his measure at their previous meeting. ALLOUTATIME (5) brings an excellent track-and-distance record and receives weight relief second-up, but she has ground to make up on THEE CREEK from their latest clash.",
